# Committed template for the gitignored .env.
#
# This project needs NO environment variables. The build reads only committed JSON
# under data/pokemon/ and writes to public/api/; there is no database, no runtime
# server, and no credential of any kind. The seed and raid/event fetchers call public
# upstream endpoints unauthenticated.
#
# If that ever changes, document every variable here (value empty) so a fresh machine
# knows what to set, and reference secrets from config as ${ENV_VAR} — never literals.
